{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/en_demo.png?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This demo offers a sneak peek at the full game experience!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your hands on the game mechanics with the tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into the Arena with a selection of 4 Heroes to test out on 3 maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get a taste of the action ahead, and face real players in the Arena</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescription_Title_EN_3v3Shooter.png?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescriptionGif_3v3Shooter.gif?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BEAST</strong> <strong>is a thrilling 3v3 multiplayer hero shooter</strong> where each match delivers quick and intense action with powerful Mechas! Choose your favorite character and dive into quick, action-packed games that offer easy, pick-up-and-play fun. <strong>BEAST</strong> offers a light-hearted, laid-back experience open to anyone, boasting quick matches full of excitement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescription_Title_EN_Mechanimals.png?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescriptionGif_Mechanimals.gif?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a dynamic dual gameplay system. <strong>Switch seamlessly between your powerful MECHA for brute strength and your agile PET</strong> for nimble tactics, each offering unique skills that bring versatility and depth to every match! Seamless transitions and sharp strategy will turn the tide in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescription_Title_EN_Heroes.png?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescriptionGif_Heroes.gif?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from <strong>a roster of unique heroes</strong>, each with their own special abilities and playstyles. Whether you prefer heavy firepower, quick strikes, or strategic defense, there\u2019s a hero that fits your gameplay and adds a new dimension to every battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescription_Title_EN_FairProgression.png?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescriptionGif_FairProgression.gif?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill matters most, not your wallet! <strong>With no microtransactions, BEAST guarantees a fair and balanced playing field for your progression</strong> where your abilities and achievements drive your success. It\u2019s all about your skills, strategy, and teamwork!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescription_Title_EN_NonStopAction.png?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescriptionGif_NonStopAction.gif?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep the excitement alive with<strong> a variety of game modes to explore and a rich solo adventure to dive into.</strong> Experiment with different hero synergies, switch to your BEAST form on the fly, and discover the best strategies to dominate the Arena. <strong>Whether you're testing your skills in multiplayer combat or uncovering each hero\u2019s story in solo mode, BEAST\u00a0offers endless ways to play!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544190?t=1741873286","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/ab5734ff37e9f30e3f9271a81bd550ed9c11b300/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741873286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/288de48dd6b1211108572ac0996bcc1f408cec41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741873286","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/288de48dd6b1211108572ac0996bcc1f408cec41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741873286","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/en_demo.png?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This demo offers a sneak peek at the full game experience!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul