<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescription_Title_EN_Heroes.png?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescriptionGif_Heroes.gif?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from <strong>a roster of unique heroes</strong>, each with their own special abilities and playstyles. Whether you prefer heavy firepower, quick strikes, or strategic defense, there\u2019s a hero that fits your gameplay and adds a new dimension to every battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescription_Title_EN_FairProgression.png?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescriptionGif_FairProgression.gif?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skill matters most, not your wallet! <strong>With no microtransactions, BEAST guarantees a fair and balanced playing field for your progression</strong> where your abilities and achievements drive your success. It\u2019s all about your skills, strategy, and teamwork!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescription_Title_EN_NonStopAction.png?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/extras/BEAST_Steam_LongDescriptionGif_NonStopAction.gif?t=1741873286\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep the excitement alive with<strong> a variety of game modes to explore and a rich solo adventure to dive into.</strong> Experiment with different hero synergies, switch to your BEAST form on the fly, and discover the best strategies to dominate the Arena. <strong>Whether you're testing your skills in multiplayer combat or uncovering each hero\u2019s story in solo mode, BEAST\u00a0offers endless ways to play!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Oh BiBi"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3239670","name":"BEAST : Bio Exo Arena Suit Team"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544190/49ef48a7a6298fe1b6caf1f599c61114d07b01ab/header.jpg?t=1741873286","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"@ 2025 Oh BiBi SAS","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257109450,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109450/movie480.mp4?t=1741684837","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109450/movie_max.mp4?t=1741684837"},"name":"BEAST: GAMEPLAY TRAILER","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257109450/9de02a838a52bd9be8d5ad454d55d97a0abc10cb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741684837","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109450/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741684837","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109450/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741684837"}}],"name":"BEAST : Bio Exo Arena Suit Team Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or more (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processo